# Contact form email (Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables)
# Without these, the contact form falls back to opening the visitor's email client (mailto).
# Sign up at resend.com, verify your sending domain, then set:
RESEND_API_KEY=
ENQUIRY_TO=hello@bodyscapes.com.au
ENQUIRY_FROM=Fifty Pages of Shades <enquiries@bodyscapes.com.au>
